creatures:
- name: Medusa
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 15  
      **Hit Points** 127 (rollable(dice=17d8 + 51,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** 30 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Initiative) (16)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=17)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=15)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Deception rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Deception Check), Perception rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Perception Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Senses** darkvision 150 ft., Passive Perception 14  
      **Languages** Common plus one other language  
      **Challenge** 6 (2,300 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +3  

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The medusa makes two Claw attacks and one Snake Hair attack, or it makes three Poison Ray attacks.

      ***Claw.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=To Hit [Claw]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d6+3,dicelabel=Damage [Claw]) Slashing damage.

      ***Snake Hair.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=To Hit [Snake Hair]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d4+3,dicelabel=Damage [Snake Hair]) Piercing damage plus rollable(dice=4d6,dicelabel=Damage [Snake Hair]) Poison damage.

      ***Poison Ray.*** *Ranged Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Poison Ray]), range 150 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d8+2,dicelabel=Damage [Poison Ray]) Poison damage.

      ## Bonus Actions

      ***Petrifying Gaze (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 5-6,dicelabel=Recharge [Petrifying Gaze])).*** *Constitution Saving Throw:* DC 13, each creature in a 30-foot ***Cone***. If the medusa sees its reflection in the ***Cone***, the medusa must make this save. *First Failure:* The target has the ***Restrained*** condition and repeats the save at the end of its next turn if it is still ***Restrained***, ending the effect on itself on a success. *Second Failure:* The target has the ***Petrified*** condition instead of the ***Restrained*** condition.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Medium Monstrosity, Lawful Evil*  
    **Challenge** 6
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024medusa
  status: 1

